{"seq": 48, "missing": [], "found_factual_error": true, "error_note_zh": "该条“类别代表性理由”字段内容描述的是郭守敬（科学、水利与元大都城市文明叙事），与本条对象郭沫若纪念馆完全不符，显系张贴了另一条目（seq45郭守敬纪念馆）的文字，应予更正。", "top_missing_zh": null, "top_missing_en": null, "error_note_en": "The content in this entry’s “reason for category representativeness” field describes Guo Shoujing (the narrative of science, water conservancy, and the urban civilization of Yuan Dadu), and is completely inconsistent with this entry’s subject, the Guo Moruo Memorial Hall; it is clearly text pasted from another entry (seq45, Guo Shoujing Memorial Hall) and should be corrected."}
